# To Talking Island (Q045): a level 3 human holding a mark of traveler accepts at Galladucci, who
# gives the first order document; Gentler trades it for a magic sword hilt, Galladucci the hilt for
# the second document, Sandra that for gemstone powder, Galladucci the powder for the third document
# and Dustin that for a purified magic necklace; Galladucci takes the necklace and the mark and pays
# with a special scroll of escape; the quest completes; then relog.
